  <data name="Pkg_Detail" xml:space="preserve"><value>Choose intel-gpu-macos-driver-VERSION-efi.zip or the folder it was unpacked to; a package beside the app is found by itself. Before a file is copied, the package's kexts and table are checked against its SHA256SUMS, as IntelXe-EFI.ps1 checks them: every file must be listed and match.</value></data>
