  <data name="Eng_Note_SsdtNotAdapted" xml:space="preserve"><value>Not added: {0}. The package's table is for {1}; the card's port here is {2}, and {3}. Put that path into SSDT-ARCOFF.dsl, compile it with iasl and copy it to EFI/OC/{4} (stage 4, step 2 of README-INSTALL.md); the plan then adds its entry.</value></data>
