  <data name="Eng_Note_HpmNoLilu" xml:space="preserve"><value>Not added: {0}. This CPU ({1}) has efficiency cores and {2} corrects its clocks, but it is a Lilu plugin and this EFI does not load {3} (no file in EFI/OC/{4}, or its Kernel &gt; Add entry is missing or off). Add Lilu (github.com/acidanthera/Lilu), then show the plan again (README-INSTALL.md, Hybrid Intel CPUs).</value></data>
