  <data name="Stick_Image_Detail" xml:space="preserve"><value>The app asks osrecovery.apple.com the way OpenCore's macrecovery.py does, with a Mac board ID for this version and an all-zero serial number: nothing about this PC is sent. The chunklist must carry Apple's signature, and every piece of BaseSystem.dmg must match its hash; a bad piece stops the download.</value></data>
