  <data name="Stick_Disk_Detail" xml:space="preserve"><value>A USB disk is still refused when Windows booted from it, when it is not removable or read-only, when it holds an operating system (Windows, macOS, Linux) or the files to copy, or when it is smaller than the image needs. Internal disks are never offered.</value></data>
