  <data name="Stick_Efi_Detail" xml:space="preserve"><value>Choose the folder named EFI (with BOOT and OC in it) or the folder that holds it. Without one, the stick holds only macOS recovery and you copy your EFI to it later. Keep IntelXe.kext and SSDT-ARCOFF.aml out of it until stage 4.</value></data>
